  "title": "Procure-to-pay process review",
  "html": "<div class=\"course-intro-card\"><h2>Procure-to-pay process review</h2><p>Identify controls and weaknesses in an automated payment workflow.</p></div><section class=\"quiz-card\"><h3>Required responses</h3><div class=\"tbs-question\"><label for=\"isc-m1-tbs2-f1\">Classification of the three-way match</label><select id=\"isc-m1-tbs2-f1\"><option value=\"Application control\">Application control</option><option value=\"Only physical security\">Only physical security</option><option value=\"An audit opinion\">An audit opinion</option><option value=\"A tax election\">A tax election</option></select></div><div class=\"tbs-question\"><label for=\"isc-m1-tbs2-f2\">Vendor-change weakness</label><select id=\"isc-m1-tbs2-f2\"><option value=\"Lack of independent authorization or segregation\">Lack of independent authorization or segregation</option><option value=\"Guaranteed security from automation\">Guaranteed security from automation</option><option value=\"Only a formatting issue\">Only a formatting issue</option><option value=\"No possible payment risk\">No possible payment risk</option></select></div><div class=\"tbs-question\"><label for=\"isc-m1-tbs2-f3\">Risk from omitted rejected records</label><select id=\"isc-m1-tbs2-f3\"><option value=\"Incomplete reconciliation information\">Incomplete reconciliation information</option><option value=\"Automatic proof of no exceptions\">Automatic proof of no exceptions</option><option value=\"No effect on completeness\">No effect on completeness</option><option value=\"A guaranteed accurate report\">A guaranteed accurate report</option></select></div><div class=\"tbs-question\"><label for=\"isc-m1-tbs2-f4\">Best next step</label><select id=\"isc-m1-tbs2-f4\"><option value=\"Trace inputs, exceptions, approvals, and postings through the full process\">Trace inputs, exceptions, approvals, and postings through the full process</option><option value=\"Review only the final total\">Review only the final total</option><option value=\"Ignore master-data changes\">Ignore master-data changes</option><option value=\"Assume the robot is an independent auditor\">Assume the robot is an independent auditor</option></select></div></section>",
